            Each pick represents a distinct point on the formulation spectrum, from thin maintenance emulsion to filled, polymer-modified flagship. We chose them from published product information, label specs such as coverage and minimum temperature, availability, and recurring patterns in owner feedback. We have not run our own test plots, and we do not publish invented durability scores.
          </p>

